# Spec-driven development

Behavior and API contracts live in `.specify/specs/` (constitution: `.specify/memory/constitution.md`).

- Before changing user-visible behavior, cookies, tokens, storage, routes, or HTTP APIs, read the matching spec. Auth: `.specify/specs/001-authentication/` (`contracts/auth.md`, `gaps.md`). Upload: `.specify/specs/006-add-content/`.
- If code and spec disagree, change the spec first or change the code to match.
- The UI never writes auth cookies. Login `Set-Cookie` is backend-only (`refresh_token`).
- New features: copy `.specify/templates/spec-template.md` into `.specify/specs/NNN-name/spec.md`.
- `API_LLD.md` indexes APIs; auth contract in `.specify/specs/001-authentication/contracts/auth.md` wins on conflicts.
